  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding independent media and civic space in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of the project is to support and to build capacity of media houses, journalists, and training institutes to have the knowledge, skills, and financial security to uphold operations, to produce public interest information and to ensure self-support systems in the long term. 
Although the programme targets the Myanmar media inside and outside of the country, the key beneficiaries of the programme are the people of Myanmar, regardless of gender, religion or ethnicity, and with an emphasis on the most marginalised and vulnerable groups in society.</narrative>
  </description>
